sequenceDiagram
  actor W as Writer
  participant FE as React (/write editor)
  participant API as Express API
  participant MOD as ModerationService
  participant DB as MongoDB
  actor R as Reviewer/Admin

  W->>FE: compose story (Quill rich text, cover image, tags)
  FE->>API: POST /api/submissions/upload (multer → Cloudinary)
  API-->>FE: image URL
  FE->>API: POST /api/submissions (title, abstract, content, category, tags)
  API->>MOD: analyzeSubmission(title, abstract, content, tags)
  MOD-->>API: { overallScore, grade, labels }
  API->>DB: save Submission (status=PENDING_REVIEW, moderation embedded)
  API-->>FE: 201 created → appears in "In Review" tab

  R->>API: GET /api/submissions?status=PENDING_REVIEW
  API-->>R: review queue (+ moderation grade per item)
  R->>API: PUT /api/submissions/:id/status { APPROVED, note }
  API->>DB: update status, save ReviewNote
  API-->>R: 200
  Note over DB: story now visible in feeds/explore
  W->>API: GET /me/stories — status PUBLISHED
